            "SeoDescription": "Memory Connectors are an interconnect system created for use with memory products. Included in this category are Inline Module Sockets, PC Card Sockets, PC Card Adapters, and Accessories. When looking for connectors to be used in tandem with SDRAM, DDR, DRAM, RAM, SGRAM, SD, miniSD, etc. Memory Connectors are where they are found.",
